(key: "warpriest/champion-of-the-faith/sacred-weapon-aligned-weapon", blueprint: "bbb2e9d744af9b347a7bd7249d5b298d", name: "Sacred Weapon - Aligned Weapon", summary: "At 4th, your weapons count as your chosen alignment against DR; from 12th, once a day add the matching property (Holy, etc.) for 1 minute.", guide: "warpriest#sacred-weapon-aligned-weapon")
